WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:04.820
Our planet faces big problems.

2
00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.680
But for every problem, people are already building solutions.

3
00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:12.020
Saving Planets brings them together in one place.

4
00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:26.680
Explore 142 real solutions across oceans, forests, lakes, rivers, and space.

5
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:33.910
New this week: satellites that track the carbon we put in the air, and Hope Spots protecting the ocean in 115 countries.

6
00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:36.200
Every one helps people and nature.

7
00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:43.950
Teachers can build free lesson plans in seconds, from kindergarten to university, tagged to NGSS-style standards.

8
00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:49.690
Kids explore the Planet Map, and students build a satellite piece by piece in 3D.

9
00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:58.010
Search any topic, discover amazing facts, and follow live launches, in English, French, Spanish, and Arabic.

10
00:00:58.230 --> 00:01:00.950
Learn it, teach it, and help save our planet.

